  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Get the last exception thrown by the <a href=\"Retryable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.retry\"><code>Retryable</code></a> operation, or an\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>InterruptedException</code></a> thrown while sleeping for the current\n<code>BackOff</code> duration.",
      "translation": "获取由 <a href=\"Retryable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.retry\"><code>Retryable</code></a> 操作抛出的最后一个异常，或者在等待当前 <code>BackOff</code> 持续时间期间因睡眠而抛出的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>InterruptedException</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "However, if an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>InterruptedException</code></a> is encountered while\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Thread.html#sleep(long)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">sleeping</a> for the current\n<a href=\"../../util/backoff/BackOff.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util.backoff\"><code>BackOff</code></a> duration, a\n<code>RetryException</code> will contain the <code>InterruptedException</code> as the\n<a href=\"#getCause()\">cause</a> and any exceptions from previous invocations\nof the <code>Retryable</code> operation as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html#getSuppressed()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">suppressed\nexceptions</a>.",
      "translation": "然而，如果在当前<a href=\"../../util/backoff/BackOff.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util.backoff\"><code>BackOff</code></a>的持续时间期间遇到<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>InterruptedException</code></a>，则<code>RetryException</code>将包含该<code>InterruptedException</code>作为<a href=\"#getCause()\">原因</a>，并将之前对<code>Retryable</code>操作的调用中产生的任何异常作为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html#getSuppressed()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">抑制的异常</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>RetryException</code> will typically contain the last exception thrown\nby the <a href=\"Retryable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.retry\"><code>Retryable</code></a> operation as the <a href=\"#getCause()\">cause</a> and\nany exceptions from previous attempts as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html#getSuppressed()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">suppressed\nexceptions</a>.",
      "translation": "<code>RetryException</code> 通常会将 <a href=\"Retryable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.retry\"><code>Retryable</code></a> 操作抛出的最后一个异常作为<a href=\"#getCause()\">cause</a>，并将之前尝试中的任何异常作为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html#getSuppressed()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">suppressed\nexceptions</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>RetryException</code> for the supplied message and cause.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<code>RetryException</code>，使用提供的消息和原因。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the number of retry attempts, or 0 if no retry has been attempted\nafter the initial invocation at all.",
      "translation": "返回重试尝试次数，如果在初始调用之后从未进行过任何重试，则返回 0。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>cause</code> - the last exception thrown by the <a href=\"Retryable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.retry\"><code>Retryable</code></a> operation,\nor an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>InterruptedException</code></a> thrown while sleeping for the current\n<code>BackOff</code> duration",
      "translation": "`cause` - 由 <a href=\"Retryable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.retry\"><code>Retryable</code></a> 操作抛出的最后一个异常，或在当前 <code>BackOff</code> 持续时间期间睡眠时抛出的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>InterruptedException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Mahmoud Ben Hassine, Juergen Hoeller, Sam Brannen",
      "translation": "Mahmoud Ben Hassine, Juergen Hoeller, Sam Brannen",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html#getCause()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">getCause</a></code> in class <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Throwable</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html#getCause()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">getCause</a></code>` 类 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Throwable</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>message</code> - the detail message",
      "translation": "<code>message</code> - 详细信息消息",
